# {app_name}

A group of Tree-sitter parsers for [Lumis](https://lumis.sh): {languages_text}.

## Installation

```elixir
def deps do
  [
    {:lumis, "~> 0.8"},
    {:{app_name}, "~> {hex_version}"}
  ]
end
```

## What it contains

Nothing but the list above. This package has no code and no parser bytes — it
depends on one `lumis_wasm_*` package per language, so adding it adds them all,
and it widens when the bundle gains a language.

Depend on the individual packages instead if you want to choose them yourself.

